{"ref":"BDB, עֲנָתוֹת","hw":"עֲנָתוֹת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָתוֹת</span></big>  and (<a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.26\">1 K 2:26</a>) <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָתֹת</span> <strong>n.pr.</strong> Αναθωθ;<br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> loc. (</strong>cf. goddess <em>Anat</em>, ref. sub foregoing<strong>)</strong>;—<a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.30\">Is 10:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.26\">1 K 2:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.1\">Je 1:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.21\">11:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.7\">32:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.9\">9</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:18\" href=\"/Joshua.21.18\">Jos 21:18</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:45\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.45\">1 Ch 6:45</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:23\" href=\"/Ezra.2.23\">Ezr 2:23</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:26\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.26\">Ne 7:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:32\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.32\">Ne 11:32</a>; mod. <em>ʿAnâtâ</em>, c. 3 miles NNE. from Jerusalem, cf. Buhl<sup>Geogr. 175</sup> GASm<sup>Geogr. 315</sup>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> m. </strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.8\">1 Ch 7:8</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.20\">Ne 10:20</a>.","next":"BDB, עַנְּתֹתִי","prev":"BDB, עֲנָת"}